<title>USA: Fleetwood Enterprises raises dividend.</title>
<headline>Fleetwood Enterprises raises dividend.</headline>
<dateline>RIVERSIDE, Calif. 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fleetwood Enterprises Inc said it increased its regular quarterly dividend to $0.17 per share from $0.16.</p>
<p>The new dividend is payable August 13 to shareholders of record July 1.</p>
</text>
